{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-17_17-50-22-hashicorp_raft-real-run && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\ncur=[i for i in json.load(open('state.json'))['interpretations'] if i['id'].startswith('caa518ff')][0]\nkn={k['id']:k for k in json.load(open('state.json'))['knowledge']}\n\npara=(\\\"Sharpened premise, no change of outcome. The verification entry now records that verifyLeader starts the future's vote count at one for the leader itself before it sizes the quorum and registers the future on every replication stream, including non-voters. Under that statement the arithmetic of every receipt in this account is explicit: with three voters the quorum is two, the leader supplies one vote, and a single non-voter acknowledgement completes the verification, which is exactly what the trigger cases show, while the control with the non-voters also cut has no second acknowledgement and fails. The four-member case with one non-voter has the same three-voter quorum and is explained the same way. Nothing in the rationale, counterevidence or limitations above depended on the leader being excluded from the count, and no receipt needs reinterpretation.\\\")\n\nans={\n \\\"1e9081120a23413eaaf020fffb085a1b-gap-0\\\":{\n  \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Reviewed the affected uses against the corrected entry. The current interpretation and the lease experiment rely on a verification succeeding while only one of three voters is reachable and the non-voters answer; the corrected premise keeps that mechanism and makes its arithmetic explicit, with the leader's self-vote plus one non-voter acknowledgement meeting a quorum of two. No conclusion, counterevidence item or limitation in those records changes, so the correction is adopted rather than requiring new evidence.\\\",\n  \\\"resolved\\\": True},\n \\\"1e9081120a23413eaaf020fffb085a1b-gap-1\\\":{\n  \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The preceding interpretation, 5ce028c2f59d4d53947fa0617d774295-interpretation-0, is superseded by the current record and rests on the same receipts. Its reading of the false success and of the lease-bounded window is unaffected by adding the self-vote, because that receipt set never asserted anything about who supplies the votes beyond the non-voter stream completing the count. It remains valid as history and is not reopened.\\\",\n  \\\"resolved\\\": True},\n}\n\nupd={\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Answer the two gaps opened by the VerifyLeader premise correction and record the sharpened arithmetic in the account. The correction adds the leader's self-vote to the verification count, which makes explicit why one non-voter acknowledgement completes a quorum of two in a three-voter configuration; neither the conclusion, the counterevidence nor the limitations depend on the opposite reading, so the affected uses stay as they are.\\\",\n \\\"interpretations\\\":[{\n  \\\"investigation_id\\\":\\\"533b966489544f45b4fcf14f6edce57f-question-0\\\",\n  \\\"experiment_id\\\":\\\"64b6f78684b04f8ea393a5827f5457c7-experiment\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":cur['source_ids'],\n  \\\"executions\\\":cur['executions'],\n  \\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"violated\\\",\n  \\\"defect_claim\\\":\\\"asserted\\\",\n  \\\"rationale\\\":cur['rationale']+\\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\"+para,\n  \\\"counterevidence\\\":cur['counterevidence'],\n  \\\"limitations\\\":cur['limitations'],\n  \\\"joint_history\\\":cur['joint_history'],\n  \\\"answers\\\":ans,\n  \\\"knowledge\\\":[\n   {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"533b966489544f45b4fcf14f6edce57f-knowledge-0\\\",\\\"revision\\\":kn['533b966489544f45b4fcf14f6edce57f-knowledge-0']['revision'],\\\"assertion\\\":\\\"verifyLeader arms the verification with the leader's own vote, sizes the quorum by voters and registers the future on every replication stream, so with three voters one non-voter acknowledgement completes it.\\\"},\n   {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"533b966489544f45b4fcf14f6edce57f-knowledge-1\\\",\\\"revision\\\":kn['533b966489544f45b4fcf14f6edce57f-knowledge-1']['revision'],\\\"assertion\\\":\\\"checkLeaderLease counts only voters, unlike VerifyLeader.\\\"},\n  ],\n }],\n}\njson.dump(upd, open('draft/update.json','w'), indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nopen('draft/update.json','a').write('\\\\n')\nprint('written')\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -c \\\"\nimport json,jsonschema\ns=json.load(open('/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-17_17-50-22-hashicorp_raft-real-run/submission.schema.json'))\nd=json.load(open('/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-17_17-50-22-hashicorp_raft-real-run/draft/update.json'))\njsonschema.validate(d,s);i=d['interpretations'][0]\nprint('schema OK ce=',len(i['counterevidence']),'lim=',len(i['limitations']),'answers=',list(i['answers']))\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
